      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Note"},
      "widgets_values": ["=== HUONG DAN - TRAINING DATA CHO NHAN VAT TRU TIEN ===\n\nWorkflow gen 6 goc nhin mot lan Queue Prompt:\n  01_front          - Mat truoc, dung\n  02_three_quarter  - Goc 3/4, nhin trai\n  03_side_profile   - Nghieng trai\n  04_back_view      - Mat sau\n  05_sitting        - Tu the ngoi\n  06_action_sword   - Cam kiem, hanh dong\n\nAnh luu tai: ComfyUI/output/lora_training_data/luxueqi/\n\nBUOC 1 - Doi ten nhan vat trong prompt (nodes 11-16):\n  Thay 'luxueqi' bang ten trigger word cua ban\n  Vi du: bidiemx, xiaozhan, tiantong...\n\nBUOC 2 - Gen anh:\n  Bam Queue Prompt -> doi seed -> gen lai nhieu lan\n  Can toi thieu 30 anh, tot nhat 50+ anh\n\nBUOC 3 - Caption anh:\n  python caption_training_images.py --input_dir output/lora_training_data/luxueqi --trigger_word luxueqi\n\nBUOC 4 - Chuan bi dataset:\n  cd train_lora\n  python prepare_dataset.py --input_dir ../output/lora_training_data/luxueqi --trigger_word \"luxueqi girl\" --repeats 15\n\nBUOC 5 - Train LoRA:\n  train.bat\n\nLUU Y FLUX: CFG thap (3.5), sampler=euler, scheduler=simple la chuan cho Flux.\nKhong co IPAdapter/ControlNet nen chat luong nhat quan phu thuoc vao prompt."]
    }
